### ============================================================
### HIMS Backend — Mock Request Collection
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" or "Thunder Client" extensions,
### or import into Postman.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Health & Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api


### ============================================================
### 1. PATIENT MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Create / Register Patient (UHID will be auto-generated by DB)
# @name createPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Rohan",
  "last_name": "Sharma",
  "date_of_birth": "1994-08-12",
  "gender": "male",
  "blood_group": "O+",
  "phone": "+919876500001",
  "email": "rohan.sharma@example.com",
  "address": "Flat 302, Green Glen Layout, Bangalore",
  "emergency_contact_name": "Sunita Sharma",
  "emergency_contact_phone": "+919876500002"
}

### 1.2 List Patients (with pagination and search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?search=Rohan&page=1&limit=10

### 1.3 Get Patient by UHID (from seed data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/uhid/HIMS-2026-00001

### 1.4 Get Patient by ID (UUID from seed data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1.5 Update Patient
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Updated Address 101, Indiranagar, Bangalore"
}


### ============================================================
### 2. OPD & APPOINTMENTS
### ============================================================

### 2.1 List All Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/departments

### 2.2 Create Department
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Neurology",
  "code": "NEUR"
}

### 2.3 List Doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/doctors

### 2.4 Book Appointment (Token number auto-assigned by DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "doctor_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "department_id": "d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "scheduled_at": "2026-10-27T10:30:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Follow-up for chest discomfort"
}

### 2.5 View OPD Queue for Cardiology
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/appointments/queue/d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/2026-10-27

### 2.6 Update Appointment Status (Doctor calls patient in)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/opd/appointments/e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}


### ============================================================
### 3. CLINICAL / EMR (Consultations)
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Create Full Consultation with Prescriptions & Referral
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clinical
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "appointment_id": "e0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "doctor_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "chief_complaint": "Mild chest pain and shortness of breath on exertion",
  "history_of_illness": "Symptoms started 3 days ago. No prior cardiac history.",
  "examination_notes": "BP: 130/85 mmHg, Pulse: 78 bpm. Heart sounds normal.",
  "diagnosis": "Non-cardiac chest pain, rule out angina",
  "icd10_codes": ["R07.9", "R06.0"],
  "follow_up_date": "2026-11-05",
  "status": "completed",
  "prescriptions": [
    {
      "drug_name": "Aspirin 75mg",
      "dosage": "75mg",
      "frequency": "Once daily after dinner",
      "duration_days": 14,
      "instructions": "Take after meals"
    },
    {
      "drug_name": "Pantoprazole 40mg",
      "dosage": "40mg",
      "frequency": "Once daily before breakfast",
      "duration_days": 14,
      "instructions": "Take on empty stomach"
    }
  ],
  "referrals": [
    {
      "referred_to_dept": "Radiology",
      "reason": "Chest X-Ray and ECG",
      "priority": "routine"
    }
  ]
}

### 3.2 Get Consultation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clinical/f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001


### ============================================================
### 4. LIMS (Laboratory Information System)
### ============================================================

### 4.1 View Lab Tests Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lims/tests

### 4.2 Order Lab Tests for Patient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lims/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "consultation_id": "f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "ordered_by": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "priority": "routine",
  "items": [
    {
      "test_id": "aa000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "test_name": "Complete Blood Count"
    },
    {
      "test_id": "aa000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "test_name": "Lipid Profile"
    }
  ]
}

### 4.3 Get Lab Order Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lims/orders/bb000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001


### ============================================================
### 5. PHARMACY & DISPENSING
### ============================================================

### 5.1 List Drugs with Current Stock & Reorder Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacy/drugs

### 5.2 Check Low Stock Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacy/drugs/alerts/low-stock

### 5.3 Add Stock Batch to Pharmacy
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacy/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drug_id": "dd000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "batch_number": "BAT-2026-999",
  "expiry_date": "2027-12-31",
  "quantity": 500
}

### 5.4 Atomic Dispense Drugs (Deducts stock FIFO with row lock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacy/dispense
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "dispensed_by": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "items": [
    {
      "drug_id": "dd000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "drug_name": "Dolo 650",
      "quantity": 10
    }
  ]
}


### ============================================================
### 6. FINANCE & INVOICING
### ============================================================

### 6.1 Create New Invoice for Patient Visit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "visit_date": "2026-10-27",
  "discount_amount": 0,
  "tax_amount": 0,
  "line_items": [
    {
      "charge_type": "consultation",
      "description": "Cardiology Consultation",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unit_price": 600.00
    }
  ]
}

### 6.2 Add Payment to Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ff000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200.00,
  "method": "upi",
  "reference_no": "UPI-TRAN-987654",
  "collected_by": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### 6.3 Get Patient Billing Summary (from PostgreSQL View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/summary/patient/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
